  "notes": "LA’s sung club-R&B hybrid — a jerkin’-scene alumnus turned Mustard-adjacent singer. Two distinguishing parameters: hats sit at **low velocity so the sung top-line stays forward**, and **snap layers replace the snare entirely on hooks**; the bass follows the sung melody’s root motion rather than the kick, which is why it is `independent_riff` here and `mirror_kick` on the rap entries around it. Strongly flat-biased keys. ⚠ **`low`**: tempo and key are measured, but the research marks the drum and harmony detail as lane-inherited `[LOW-CONF]`.",
